                                  'String? = nil,\n'
                                  '                method: MerchantTemplateMethod? = nil) {\n'
                                  '        sourceFields = ["hint1": hint1, "hint2": hint2, "answerReveal": '
                                  'answerReveal].compactMapValues { $0 }\n'
                                  '        // An absent/empty group has no method-dependent source state. '
